{"seq":1,"slug":"device-account-address-graph","title":"设备/账号/地址关联图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/fraud-graph-gang/device-account-address-graph","wordCount":2412,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"设备-账号-地址关联图谱\">设备/账号/地址关联图谱</h1><p>单点风控看的是属性，图谱看的是关系。这个转变的前提是先有一张能表达关系的图，而这张图的建模难点几乎全部集中在同一个问题上：<strong>两个不同的标识符，什么时候应该被认为指向同一个实体。</strong> 建模错了，后面的社区发现和风险传播再精确也只会放大错误。这一篇讲这张图的实体模型、边模型，以及实体消歧的判定方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-图里放什么\">核心概念：图里放什么</h2><p>电商反欺诈图里值得建模的实体不需要很多，四到六类足够覆盖绝大多数团伙形态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实体类型</th>\n<th>标识来源</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>消歧难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账号 account</td>\n<td>用户注册 ID</td>\n<td>高（除非被封重开）</td>\n<td>低（天然唯一）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备 device</td>\n<td>设备指纹、SDK 上报的设备 ID</td>\n<td>中（可被重置、可被伪造）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址 address</td>\n<td>收货地址结构化字段</td>\n<td>中（合租、代收点、快递柜）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付工具 payment</td>\n<td>卡 BIN + 卡号哈希、钱包账号</td>\n<td>中（可补卡、可换绑）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联系方式 contact</td>\n<td>手机号、邮箱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络网络 network</td>\n<td>IP、自治系统、代理特征</td>\n<td>低（动态分配）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>边的类型只需要两类，但必须严格区分：<strong>共现边</strong>（co-occurrence，两个实体在同一事件里同时出现）与<strong>归属边</strong>（ownership，一个实体被判定属于另一个实体）。这个区分看起来是语义洁癖，实际上决定了图算法的全部行为——共现边是弱信号，可以有很多条、互相矛盾；归属边是强断言，必须唯一且有依据。把它们混在一张边表里，社区发现会把所有共现当成同伙关系。</p>\n<p>设备指纹的采集与稳定标识本身是另一个 hub 的范围（见 <code>030_user-account-address-identity</code>）；本 hub 消费的是设备 ID 作为图的节点，不讨论它是怎么算出来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实体消歧-从共现到同一\">实体消歧：从共现到同一</h2><h3 id=\"确定性与概率性两类判定\">确定性与概率性两类判定</h3><p>消歧方法分两族。<strong>确定性匹配</strong>用规则做等值连接，例如「同一个手机号验证过的两个账号」——这条规则几乎不会错，但覆盖率低。<strong>概率性匹配</strong>用统计模型估计「这两条记录指向同一个实体的概率」，覆盖率显著更高，但会引入假阳性。概率性匹配的经典框架是 Fellegi–Sunter 模型：它把一对记录表示为一个比较向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>（每个字段是「一致」或「不一致」），并估计两个概率——真实匹配对中该比较模式出现的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(\\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，以及非匹配对中出现的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(\\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。对单个字段，一致时贡献权重</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>agree</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>disagree</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{agree}} = \\log_2 \\frac{m}{u}, \\qquad W_{\\text{disagree}} = \\log_2 \\frac{1-m}{1-u}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">agree</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disagree</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各字段权重求和得到该记录对的总分，再与上下两个阈值比较：高于上阈值判为同一实体，低于下阈值判为不同，中间区间进入人工复核（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Record_linkage\">Record linkage / Fellegi–Sunter</a>）。这套方法在电商地址消歧上尤其有用，因为地址字段天然是模糊的（同一栋楼的不同写法）且各字段的区分能力差异极大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>典型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>agree</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{agree}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">agree</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量级</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手机号</td>\n<td>0.95</td>\n<td>0.001</td>\n<td>高（约 9.9）</td>\n<td>强区分，但换绑后失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收货地址（归一化）</td>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>0.02</td>\n<td>中（约 5.3）</td>\n<td>需密度惩罚修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收货人姓名</td>\n<td>0.90</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>中（约 4.2）</td>\n<td>常见姓名会推高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备型号</td>\n<td>0.70</td>\n<td>0.30</td>\n<td>低（约 1.2）</td>\n<td>几乎无区分力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"地址消歧的特殊性\">地址消歧的特殊性</h3><p>地址是四类实体里最难的一类，原因是它同时存在两种相反的错误。<strong>过度合并</strong>会把一个真实的快递代收点、一栋合租公寓、一个写字楼里几十个不相干的公司合并成「一个团伙」；<strong>合并不足</strong>则会让团伙每换一个收货地址就消失一次。可行的做法是分层：先做<strong>地理归一化</strong>（把地址解析到标准行政区划与门牌粒度），再做<strong>密度惩罚</strong>——如果一个归一化后的地址下挂载的账号数远超该地区基准，这个地址的区分能力就应当被下调。一个有一万个账号的地址是代收点，不是团伙据点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 地址节点的区分能力：按挂载账号数相对地区基准做密度惩罚&#10;CREATE TABLE graph_address (&#10;  address_id      TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  geo_normalized  TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 归一化到 省/市/区/街道/门牌&#10;  region_code     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  account_count   INT  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  region_base_p50 NUMERIC NOT NULL,        -- 同地区账号挂载数中位数&#10;  discrimination  NUMERIC GENERATED ALWAYS AS (&#10;    LEAST(1.0, region_base_p50::numeric / GREATEST(account_count, 1))&#10;  ) STORED,&#10;  updated_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_addr_geo ON graph_address (geo_normalized);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_addr_region ON graph_address (region_code);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 地址节点的区分能力：按挂载账号数相对地区基准做密度惩罚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> graph_address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  address_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  geo_normalized  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归一化到 省/市/区/街道/门牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  region_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_count   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  region_base_p50 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 同地区账号挂载数中位数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  discrimination  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    LEAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, region_base_p50::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(account_count, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_addr_geo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph_address (geo_normalized);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_addr_region</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph_address (region_code);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>discrimination</code> 这个生成列是下游图算法的输入：值接近 1 表示这个地址能区分人（独栋住宅），接近 0 表示它不能（代收点）。社区发现的边权重会乘上它。同一种「地址共享」关系，在独栋住宅上是强信号，在快递柜上是零信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"设备消歧必须承认伪造\">设备消歧必须承认伪造</h3><p>设备 ID 的可信度不是常量。越狱/root 设备、模拟器、群控设备会重放或篡改设备指纹。因此在设备节点上必须挂一个<strong>可信度</strong>字段，且它随行为动态调整。NIST 在身份证明规范里对「1:N 生物特征去重」的处理方式值得借用：它允许用去重来发现同一人重复注册，但要求达到明确的准确度门槛（误报识别率优于 1:1000），且<strong>不得仅凭自动 1:N 匹配就拒绝注册</strong>，必须由真人复核确认这不是误报（<a href=\"https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63a.html\">NIST SP 800-63A</a>）。这个「自动给出候选、人工确认合并」的模式，正是图消歧最稳妥的落地方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图的数据模型\">图的数据模型</h2><p>图不需要专门的图数据库才能起步。中小规模下，一张边表配合递归查询就够用；超过千万级边之后再引入图引擎。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 统一的边表：共现与归属分开，权重可比化&#10;CREATE TABLE graph_edge (&#10;  src_type   TEXT NOT NULL,      -- account | device | address | payment | contact&#10;  src_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  dst_type   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  dst_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  edge_kind  TEXT NOT NULL,      -- &#39;co_occur&#39; | &#39;ownership&#39;&#10;  relation   TEXT NOT NULL,      -- logged_in_on | shipped_to | paid_with | verified_by&#10;  occurrences INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  first_seen TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  last_seen  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  confidence NUMERIC NOT NULL DEFAULT 0.5,   -- 归属边的断言强度；共现边恒为观测频率的归一化值&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (src_type, src_id, dst_type, dst_id, edge_kind, relation)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 反向边由写入侧维护，保证双向遍历对称&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_edge_dst ON graph_edge (dst_type, dst_id, edge_kind);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_edge_recent ON graph_edge (last_seen DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 统一的边表：共现与归属分开，权重可比化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> graph_edge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  src_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- account | device | address | payment | contact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  src_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dst_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dst_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  edge_kind  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'co_occur' | 'ownership'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  relation   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- logged_in_on | shipped_to | paid_with | verified_by</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurrences </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  first_seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_seen  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归属边的断言强度；共现边恒为观测频率的归一化值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (src_type, src_id, dst_type, dst_id, edge_kind, relation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 反向边由写入侧维护，保证双向遍历对称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_edge_dst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph_edge (dst_type, dst_id, edge_kind);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_edge_recent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph_edge (last_seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张表有两个刻意的设计。第一，<code>occurrences</code> 与 <code>first_seen/last_seen</code> 让「一次共现」和「一千次共现」可区分，也让「三个月前的共现」和「昨天的共现」可区分——后者的权重更高，因为团伙的活跃关系比历史关系更有预测力。第二，<code>confidence</code> 对共现边承载的是<strong>归一化后的观测频率</strong>，对归属边承载的是<strong>断言强度</strong>，两者语义不同但都落在 0-1，让下游可以有统一的乘法衰减。</p>\n<p>不要让共现边和归属边共用一个 <code>relation</code> 命名空间。一旦出现 <code>relation = &#39;same_person&#39;</code> 这样的边混在 <code>logged_in_on</code> 旁边，社区发现会把「同一个物理设备的多次登录」和「同一个人开了两个账号」当成同一种关系处理，而这两者的含义完全相反。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图写入的幂等与顺序\">图写入的幂等与顺序</h2><p>图谱的写入是流式的：事件源不断产生「账号 A 在设备 D 上登录」「订单 O 寄往地址 R」。这里有两个工程约束。</p>\n<p><strong>第一个是幂等。</strong> 同一个事件被重复消费（消息重投、回溯重放）不能让 <code>occurrences</code> 翻倍。做法是给每条边维护一个去重的近期事件 ID 集合，或让事件源携带单调递增的偏移量，写入侧只接受更大的偏移。后者的代价是顺序前提——同一对实体的事件必须落在同一个分区。</p>\n<p><strong>第二个是乱序容忍。</strong> 流式系统里事件到达顺序与发生顺序不一致是常态。<code>first_seen</code> 必须取 <code>min</code>，<code>last_seen</code> 必须取 <code>max</code>，而不是直接覆盖为「当前事件时间」。这个小细节决定了图上的时间过滤是否可靠。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归属边不能用同一套写入路径\">归属边不能用同一套写入路径</h3><p>共现边可以从事件流直接累加，归属边不行。归属边是一次<strong>断言</strong>，它要么来自确定性规则（同手机号验证），要么来自消歧模型的判定结果，要么来自人工确认。三者都必须留下 <code>source</code> 与 <code>asserted_by</code> 字段，否则当归属边被证明错误时（两个账号其实是同一人的正常多开），无法确定是哪个环节引入的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;edge_kind&quot;: &quot;ownership&quot;,&#10;  &quot;src&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;account&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: &quot;acc--71f2...&quot; },&#10;  &quot;dst&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;contact&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: &quot;ctc--3a88...&quot; },&#10;  &quot;relation&quot;: &quot;verified_by&quot;,&#10;  &quot;asserted_by&quot;: &quot;deterministic_rule:same_verified_phone&quot;,&#10;  &quot;asserted_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-10T04:12:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;confidence&quot;: 0.99,&#10;  &quot;revocable&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;evidence_ref&quot;: &quot;verify_event--9912...&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"edge_kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ownership\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"account\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acc--71f2...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dst\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"contact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ctc--3a88...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"relation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"verified_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"asserted_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deterministic_rule:same_verified_phone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"asserted_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-10T04:12:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"revocable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"verify_event--9912...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>revocable: true</code> 标记了这条归属边是否可以在被证伪时撤销。确定性规则产生的边几乎总是可撤销的（换绑手机号后就不再成立）；而人工确认的团伙归属边可能不可撤销，因为它记录的是一个历史判断而不是一个可观测事实。这个区分让回溯性纠正有了正确的作用范围。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[业务事件流&lt;br/&gt;登录/下单/收货/改绑] --&gt; B[实体解析&lt;br/&gt;标识符标准化]&#10;  B --&gt; C{已有边?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[插入边&lt;br/&gt;occurrences=1]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E{事件偏移量更大?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[丢弃:重复事件]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[合并更新&lt;br/&gt;occ+1, last_seen=max]&#10;  D --&gt; H[异步消歧任务]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{消歧候选分 &gt; 上阈值?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[创建归属边]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K{落入灰区?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[人工复核队列]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[不建立归属边]&#10;  J --&gt; N[图谱快照&lt;br/&gt;供社区发现消费]&#10;  L --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[业务事件流&lt;br/&gt;登录/下单/收货/改绑] --&gt; B[实体解析&lt;br/&gt;标识符标准化]\n  B --&gt; C{已有边?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[插入边&lt;br/&gt;occurrences=1]\n  C --&gt;|是| E{事件偏移量更大?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[丢弃:重复事件]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[合并更新&lt;br/&gt;occ+1, last_seen=max]\n  D --&gt; H[异步消歧任务]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{消歧候选分 &gt; 上阈值?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[创建归属边]\n  I --&gt;|否| K{落入灰区?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[人工复核队列]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[不建立归属边]\n  J --&gt; N[图谱快照&lt;br/&gt;供社区发现消费]\n  L --&gt; J</pre><p>图快照是给 <a href=\"gang-cluster-detect\">团伙聚簇与社区发现</a> 的输入契约：它必须是某一时刻的一致性切面，而不是边表的实时视图。社区发现算法在迭代过程中如果图在变，结果不可复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>需要建模的实体不超过六类，但<strong>共现边与归属边必须分开存储</strong>——把它们混在一起是这一类图谱最常见的建模错误。</li>\n<li>概率性消歧用 Fellegi-Sunter 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m/u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 权重框架，中间灰区交人工复核；确定性规则只用于高置信场景以控制假阳性。</li>\n<li>地址必须做密度惩罚：一个归一化地址的区分能力与该地址挂载的账号数成反比，代收点与独栋住宅的信号强度相差几个数量级。</li>\n<li>设备可信度是动态量，NIST 关于 1:N 去重「自动给候选、人工确认」的模式可直接迁移。</li>\n<li>边表要保留 <code>occurrences</code> 与 <code>first_seen/last_seen</code>，写入必须幂等且对乱序容忍（<code>first_seen</code> 取 min、<code>last_seen</code> 取 max）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>图建好之后，下一个问题是怎样从这张稀疏且带噪声的图里切出团伙，见 <a href=\"gang-cluster-detect\">团伙聚簇与社区发现</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"设备/账号/地址关联图谱","id":"设备-账号-地址关联图谱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：图里放什么","id":"核心概念-图里放什么"},{"level":2,"text":"实体消歧：从共现到同一","id":"实体消歧-从共现到同一"},{"level":3,"text":"确定性与概率性两类判定","id":"确定性与概率性两类判定"},{"level":3,"text":"地址消歧的特殊性","id":"地址消歧的特殊性"},{"level":3,"text":"设备消歧必须承认伪造","id":"设备消歧必须承认伪造"},{"level":2,"text":"图的数据模型","id":"图的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"图写入的幂等与顺序","id":"图写入的幂等与顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"归属边不能用同一套写入路径","id":"归属边不能用同一套写入路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"确诊欺诈回流与样本沉淀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/fraud-intel-production/confirmed-fraud-feedback"},"next":{"title":"团伙聚簇与社区发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/fraud-graph-gang/gang-cluster-detect"}}